1
00:00:00,167 --> 00:00:04,680
Have you ever wished a product existed, but couldn't find anyone making it?

2
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:07,411
Or bought something that could have been designed better?

3
00:00:07,511 --> 00:00:14,058
GENESIS connects people with product ideas to manufacturers who can bring those ideas closer to reality.

4
00:00:14,158 --> 00:00:19,290
Anyone can share an idea, and approved manufacturers can respond with offers.

5
00:00:20,967 --> 00:00:25,511
Imagine you need a portable audio interface that records eight microphones at once.

6
00:00:25,611 --> 00:00:31,079
You open GENESIS, describe what you need, choose the features that matter, and publish your idea.

7
00:00:31,179 --> 00:00:34,436
That's it. Other people can now discover your request.

8
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:41,247
GENESIS Intelligence helps turn your idea into clearer product requirements.

9
00:00:41,347 --> 00:00:50,407
It organizes the important features, identifies questions that still need answers, and gives you a specification you can review, edit, and save.

10
00:00:50,507 --> 00:00:53,343
You stay in control of your idea.

11
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,759
Other consumers can explore ideas and show they're interested.

12
00:00:58,859 --> 00:01:02,475
They can also report problems with products they already use.

13
00:01:02,575 --> 00:01:07,331
This gives manufacturers a clearer view of what people want and what needs improvement.

14
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:14,071
For manufacturers, GENESIS provides a place to discover real customer requests.

15
00:01:14,171 --> 00:01:19,976
They can review an idea, propose to build it, share pricing, and update progress.

16
00:01:20,076 --> 00:01:23,235
Every offer stays linked to the original request.

17
00:01:23,335 --> 00:01:28,888
Customer feedback also helps them decide what to improve before or after a product reaches the market.

18
00:01:30,567 --> 00:01:36,393
When a manufacturer has an eligible offer, a verified consumer can continue to PayPal checkout.

19
00:01:36,493 --> 00:01:41,175
GENESIS checks the Sandbox payment result before recording the order as confirmed.

20
00:01:41,275 --> 00:01:45,265
Both the purchase and its progress can then be followed inside the platform.

21
00:01:46,934 --> 00:01:54,458
For consumers, GENESIS means a voice in what gets created, better visibility, and a way to support useful ideas.

22
00:01:54,558 --> 00:02:02,288
For manufacturers, it means clearer demand, practical feedback, and a direct path from customer interest to a purchase.

23
00:02:04,167 --> 00:02:07,985
PayPal GENESIS. Products should begin with people.
